5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a system that doesn't fracture our community. I’m worried about resentment building over time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Asuka! I’ve heard people grumbling that the same spots always go to the same doors. I want to check if that’s actually true or just resentment.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is a shoving match. Where your bike ends up determines its condition by evening. I need to see the actual layout and usage patterns.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m curious about the actual costs. Every proposal asks what it costs the building, yet nobody checks. I want to see the ledger and the station park rates.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m concerned about the long-term maintenance burden. I want to see the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file to understand the actual workload.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: I’m concerned about the long-term maintenance burden. I want to see the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file to understand the actual workload.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, checking the sticker register and the complaint log will tell us if the grumbling is fact or just noise.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that sounds perfect! I’ll check the sticker register and the five years of minutes to see if the spots really stayed the same.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, I’ll check the morning departures and the rain exposure. I need to know exactly where the friction and damage happen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, good call. I’ll stick to the ledger and the station park rates. I need hard numbers, not just feelings, to see if we can actually afford this.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, noted. I’ll check the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file. I need to know the actual workload before we commit.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, the workload matters, but so does the social cost. I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account to see how this bites.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that’s a great idea! I’ll check the sticker register and the five years of minutes to see if the spots really stayed the same.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
