18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the social cost is real, but it’s not free either. I’m sticking to the ledger and the station park rates. I need hard numbers to see if we can actually afford this.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
