20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I need to see how these arrangements actually fracture communities before we vote.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
