60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, Option C avoids the billing trap that isolated the neighbours. No monthly charges means no arrears, no missed meetings, and no social fracture.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I agree! No billing means no one gets left behind. But @Ryuji, won’t the dry spots still get grabbed by the same people?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, the double-tier racks eliminate the shifting bottleneck. Rain is a separate issue. We fix the flow first, then address the weather.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, Option A is a trap. The ledger is empty, and the station park charges 2,600 yen. We can’t afford to subsidize it. I’m voting C.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, Option A is a trap. The ledger is empty, and the station park charges 2,600 yen. We can’t afford to subsidize it. I’m voting C.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, @Toshio, I agree. Option C is the only one that doesn’t fracture us. I’m voting C.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I’m voting C too! It’s the only option that doesn’t create new headaches for the treasurer. Let’s keep it simple and fair!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, the racks solve the morning bottleneck. The rain exposure remains, but that’s a separate fix. I’m voting C.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, you’re parroting me again. Fine, we’re aligned. Option C is the only one that doesn’t bankrupt us or isolate people. I’m voting C.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, I’m not parroting you. I’m voting C. It avoids the billing trap and the maintenance burden that would quietly kill any other plan.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, the dry spots will still be contested, but at least no one is financially excluded. I’m voting C.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I know the dry spots are tricky, but at least everyone gets a fair shot! I’m voting C too. Let’s keep the peace!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the rain is a known variable. The bottleneck is the critical failure. I am voting C.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the dry spots are a minor inconvenience compared to financial ruin. Option C is the only viable path. I’m voting C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, the dry spots are a minor inconvenience compared to financial ruin. Option C is the only viable path. I’m voting C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Everyone, the vote is unanimous. Option C is adopted. We avoid the billing trap and the social fracture. Let’s move forward.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, Yay! Unanimous! I’m so happy we found a solution that keeps everyone happy and the peace intact. Great job, everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, agreed. The bottleneck is resolved. I’ll monitor the morning flow to ensure the racks actually work as intended.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, Unanimous. Good. Now someone actually has to grease those springs twice a year. Don’t expect me to volunteer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, noted. I’ll draft a rotation schedule for the greasing. It’s a small task, but it needs a name attached to it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
